Common CreditsByCourse
    documentation "The total credits required to graduation by taking a specific course, or by taking one or more from a set of courses."
    shared string CourseSetName
        documentation "Identifying name given to a collection of courses."
        is part of identity
    domain entity Course
        documentation "The course reference that identifies the organization of subject matter and related learning experiences provided for the instruction of students."
        is required collection
        role name Course
    inline common Credits
        documentation "The value of credits or units of value awarded for the completion of a course."
        is required
    descriptor GradeLevel
        documentation "The grade level when the student is planned to take the course."
        is optional
        role name WhenTaken